From 5783824d02fd92f616020dda79e6d5b9279d5ba4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: baverrr <342259467+baverrr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 18:36:58 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] LatinIME: Add the RavenOS glass keyboard theme

Add a "RavenOS Glass" keyboard theme to match the RavenOS glass Settings
theme, and make it the default:

- Glass letter keys, darker functional keys, a pill spacebar and a solid
  enter key, drawn with shape drawables over the LXX dark layouts and
  icons.
- The keyboard background is the bottom band of the Settings backdrop,
  so the keyboard reads as part of the screen behind it.
- Every color comes from res/values/raven_glass.xml so a product overlay
  can recolor it.

Material Light, Material Dark and Follow system stay selectable.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I4c2c5b53715518a63e0bf32aaacf8d5c2c4ae01a
